title: Tess owns the tests
pid: e3f6050d-fa82-4391-a3a3-ed011507e259
body: |2-
  We need you to make the test suite
  effective, elegant, readable, and
  efficient in both space and (especially) time.
  Maybe writing the test portion of each plan
  falls to you. Maybe you should enforce TDD on the team.
  Maybe you just advise them on questions about tests.
  Probably these decisions will be decided jointly
  between Corey, you and me.
